<BaseLayout title="Privacy policy | Zion Creative" description="Privacy policy for Zion Creative."><Header/><main id="main" class="container policy-page"><h1>Privacy policy</h1><p>Zion Creative is based in Springfield, Illinois. For website, privacy, or accessibility questions, contact <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a>.</p>
<h2>Information you choose to share</h2><p>The inquiry form is provided by Elfsight. If you load and submit it, your contact information and the project details you provide are sent through that service so your inquiry can be received and answered. Please provide only what is needed to discuss your project. Do not include passwords, financial account details, or sensitive personal information.</p>
<h2>Website delivery and optional services</h2><p>This website is hosted through Cloudflare. Delivering and protecting the website involves processing technical information such as IP addresses, browser details, and requests for pages. Cloudflare also supplies a browser beacon for traffic and performance measurement on the live site. See <a href="https://www.cloudflare.com/privacypolicy/">Cloudflare’s privacy policy</a>.</p><p>Elfsight forms and reviews load directly on the relevant pages. The Calendly scheduler also loads directly on the consultation page. These providers receive technical information when their services load and may use cookies or similar technologies. See <a href="https://elfsight.com/privacy-policy/">Elfsight’s privacy policy</a> and <a href="https://calendly.com/legal/privacy-notice">Calendly’s privacy notice</a>. Following an external link takes you to that provider’s website and privacy choices.</p>
<h2>Optional Google Analytics</h2><p>With your permission, Google Analytics measures page visits and clicks on our email and phone links to help us understand how visitors find and use this website. It uses cookies and processes technical information about your device and visits. We disable advertising personalization and Google signals. We do not send the contents of inquiry fields, email addresses, phone numbers, or URL query strings to Google Analytics. Email and phone link clicks indicate contact interest, not a completed inquiry. Read <a href="https://policies.google.com/technologies/partner-sites">how Google uses information from sites that use its services</a>. Use Analytics choices in the footer to allow or decline this optional measurement. A Global Privacy Control signal prevents this analytics tag from loading.</p>
<h2>Cookies and choices</h2><p>See the <a href="/cookies">cookies policy</a> for information about third-party embeds and browser storage used on this site. Loading an embed is separate from submitting a form. A project inquiry is not an opt-in to unrelated marketing.</p>
<h2>Questions and requests</h2><p>To ask about information you have provided, request a correction or deletion, or discuss how long project correspondence is held, use <a href="mailto:hello@zioncreative.co">hello@zioncreative.co</a> or <a href="tel:+12177252031">217.725.2031</a>. Include enough information to identify your inquiry, but do not send identity documents or sensitive information in an initial message. Applicable legal and contractual recordkeeping requirements may affect a request.</p></main><Footer/></BaseLayout>
